{
  "cmd_full_name": "ecd describe-price",
  "cmd_name": "describe-price",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Queries the purchase price of Elastic Desktop Service products",
  "description_zh": "查询无影商品的新购价格",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun ecd describe-price --biz-region-id cn-hangzhou --resource-type Desktop --instance-type eds.general.2c2g --root-disk-size-gib 80 --user-disk-size-gib 100 --os-type Windows --period-unit Hour --period 1 --amount 1 --promotion-id 123456 --internet-charge-type PayByTraffic --bandwidth 10 --root-disk-performance-level PL0 --user-disk-performance-level PL0 --group-desktop-count 1 --duration 120 --root-disk-category 40 --user-disk-category 80 --reseller-owner-uid 1422724566551 --api-version 2020-09-30 --region cn-hangzhou",
  "method": "GET|POST",
  "multi_version": true,
  "name": "DescribePrice",
  "operation": {
    "action": "DescribePrice",
    "api_style": "RPC",
    "api_version": "2020-09-30",
    "method": "POST",
    "operation_type": "read",
    "protocol": "HTTPS",
    "system_operation_type": "list",
    "url": ""
  },
  "parameters": [
    {
      "doc_required": true,
      "example": "cn-hangzhou",
      "help_en": "The region ID. You can call [DescribeRegions](~~DescribeRegions~~) to query the regions supported by Elastic Desktop Service",
      "help_zh": "地域ID。可以调用[DescribeRegions](~~DescribeRegions~~)获取无影云电脑支持的地域列表",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "region_id",
      "options": [
        "--biz-region-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "RegionId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "Desktop",
      "help_en": "The resource type",
      "help_zh": "资源类型",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "resource_type",
      "options": [
        "--resource-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ResourceType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "eds.general.2c2g",
      "help_en": "The resource specification.\n\nIf ResourceType is set to Desktop, this parameter is required. You can call [DescribeDesktopTypes](~~DescribeDesktopTypes~~) to query available values (corresponding to the DesktopTypeId value).\n\nIf ResourceType is set to DesktopGroup, set this parameter to `large`.\n\nIf ResourceType is set to Bandwidth, you do not need to specify this parameter",
      "help_zh": "资源规格。\n\n当`ResourceType`为`Desktop`时，该字段必填。可以调用[DescribeDesktopTypes](~~DescribeDesktopTypes~~)查询可用的值（对应`DesktopTypeId`的值）。\n\n当`ResourceType`为`DesktopGroup`时，取值为`large`。\n\n当`ResourceType`为`Bandwidth`时，可以不传入该参数",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "instance_type",
      "options": [
        "--instance-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "InstanceType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "80",
      "help_en": "The system cloud disk size. Unit: GiB. If ResourceType is set to Desktop, this parameter is required",
      "help_zh": "系统盘大小。单位：GiB。当`ResourceType`为`Desktop`时，该字段必填",
      "location": "query",
      "maximum": "32768",
      "minimum": "0",
      "name": "root_disk_size_gib",
      "options": [
        "--root-disk-size-gib"
      ],
      "raw_name": "RootDiskSizeGib",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "100",
      "help_en": "The data cloud disk size. Unit: GiB",
      "help_zh": "数据盘大小。单位：GiB",
      "location": "query",
      "maximum": "65536",
      "minimum": "0",
      "name": "user_disk_size_gib",
      "options": [
        "--user-disk-size-gib"
      ],
      "raw_name": "UserDiskSizeGib",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "Windows",
      "help_en": "The operating system type",
      "help_zh": "操作系统类型",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "os_type",
      "options": [
        "--os-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "OsType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "Hour",
      "help_en": "The billing cycle",
      "help_zh": "计费周期",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "period_unit",
      "options": [
        "--period-unit"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PeriodUnit",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The subscription duration. Valid values are determined by the PeriodUnit parameter.\n\nIf PeriodUnit is set to Hour, the valid value is 1.\nIf PeriodUnit is set to Month, valid values are 1, 2, 3, and 6.\nIf PeriodUnit is set to Year, valid values are 1, 2, and 3.\n\nDefault value: 1",
      "help_zh": "购买时长。取值范围由参数`PeriodUnit`的值决定。\n\n`PeriodUnit`为`Hour`时，取值范围为：1。\n`PeriodUnit`为`Month`时，取值范围为：1、2、3、6。\n`PeriodUnit`为`Year`时，取值范围为：1、2、3。\n\n默认值：1",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "period",
      "options": [
        "--period"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Period",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The resource count. Default value: 1",
      "help_zh": "资源数量。默认值为1",
      "location": "query",
      "maximum": "1000",
      "minimum": "1",
      "name": "amount",
      "options": [
        "--amount"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Amount",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "123456",
      "help_en": "The promotion ID",
      "help_zh": "促销活动ID",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "promotion_id",
      "options": [
        "--promotion-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "PromotionId",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "PayByTraffic",
      "help_en": "The billing method of the Internet access package",
      "help_zh": "互联网访问包的计费方式",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "internet_charge_type",
      "options": [
        "--internet-charge-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "InternetChargeType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "10",
      "help_en": "The peak Internet bandwidth. Unit: Mbit/s.\n\nFor pay-by-bandwidth, valid values are 10 to 1000.\nFor pay-by-traffic, valid values are 10 to 200",
      "help_zh": "公网带宽峰值。单位：Mbps。\n\n按固定带宽计费时，取值范围为10\\~1000。\n按使用流量计费时，取值范围为10\\~200",
      "location": "query",
      "maximum": "5120",
      "minimum": "1",
      "name": "bandwidth",
      "options": [
        "--bandwidth"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Bandwidth",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "PL0",
      "help_en": "The performance level (PL) of the system cloud disk. You can set the disk performance level when the cloud desktop specification is set to Graphics or High Frequency. For more information about the differences between performance levels, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/122389.html",
      "help_zh": "系统盘的性能等级。当云电脑规格设置为图形型或者高主频时，支持设置磁盘性能等级。关于各性能等级磁盘的差异，请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/122389.html",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "root_disk_performance_level",
      "options": [
        "--root-disk-performance-level"
      ],
      "raw_name": "RootDiskPerformanceLevel",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "PL0",
      "help_en": "The performance level (PL) of the data cloud disk. You can set the disk performance level when the cloud desktop specification is set to Graphics or High Frequency. For more information about the differences between performance levels, see https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/122389.html",
      "help_zh": "数据盘的性能等级。当云电脑规格设置为图形型或者高主频时，支持设置磁盘性能等级。关于各性能等级磁盘的差异，请参见https://help.aliyun.com/document_detail/122389.html",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "user_disk_performance_level",
      "options": [
        "--user-disk-performance-level"
      ],
      "raw_name": "UserDiskPerformanceLevel",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1",
      "help_en": "The number of shared cloud desktops. Default value: 1.\n\nThis parameter takes effect only when ResourceType is set to DesktopGroup",
      "help_zh": "共享型云电脑的数量，默认值为1。\n\n当`ResourceType`为`DesktopGroup`时，该值有效",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "group_desktop_count",
      "options": [
        "--group-desktop-count"
      ],
      "raw_name": "GroupDesktopCount",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "120",
      "help_en": "The duration package type for monthly cloud desktop purchases. If ResourceType is set to DesktopMonthPackage, this parameter is required",
      "help_zh": "按月购买云电脑时的时长包类型。当`ResourceType`为`DesktopMonthPackage`时，该字段必填",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "duration",
      "options": [
        "--duration"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Duration",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    },
    {
      "example": "40",
      "help_en": "The system cloud disk type",
      "help_zh": "系统盘类型",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "root_disk_category",
      "options": [
        "--root-disk-category"
      ],
      "raw_name": "RootDiskCategory",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "80",
      "help_en": "The data cloud disk type",
      "help_zh": "数据盘类型",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "user_disk_category",
      "options": [
        "--user-disk-category"
      ],
      "raw_name": "UserDiskCategory",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "1422724566551XXX",
      "help_en": "The user ID for resource ownership in reseller mode. You do not need to specify this parameter in non-reseller mode",
      "help_zh": "转售模式的资源归属用户ID，非转售模式无需填写该参数",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "reseller_owner_uid",
      "options": [
        "--reseller-owner-uid"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ResellerOwnerUid",
      "required": false,
      "type": "int"
    }
  ],
